+
+/**
+ * An absolute URL as data: {scheme, body, query, fragment, decoration}, where the body is
+ * {opaque} or {authority?, path}. Special schemes take an authority 90% of the time and a path;
+ * the others an opaque path or (50%) an authority and a path.
